Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:17:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] theme: follow the active Omarchy theme

Recolor the light and dark themes with ~/.local/state/omarchy/current/theme/
colors.toml (accent, background, foreground, raised and muted shades, error,
green) and re-apply when Omarchy switches theme. A Desktop Settings switch turns
it off. Unit tests for the scale math and the colors.toml parser.
